      }
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Ear first, names second",
      "body": "Listen to two notes, sing them back, then find them on the keys. That is how you already learned to play, so it is the fastest way for you to learn intervals too.",
      "exampleMidi": [
        60,
        67
      ],
      "labels": {
